---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — How GEO Audit Handles Your Data"
  description="How GEO Audit collects, stores, and uses your data."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 prose-sm">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: 22 February 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">What we collect</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2">When you run an audit, we collect:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1">
        <li>The URL you submit</li>
        <li>Publicly available data from that URL (page content, meta tags, structured data, robots.txt)</li>
        <li>The generated audit report and score</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mt-2">
        We do not require an account or collect personal information such as your name or email to run an audit.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">How we use your data</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1">
        <li>To generate and display your audit report</li>
        <li>To improve the audit engine and scoring methodology</li>
        <li>We may retain audit reports and use publicly available contact information associated with audited websites to reach out about our services</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Data storage</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        Audit data is stored on Google Cloud (Firebase/Firestore) in the europe-west2 region. Anonymous audit results are accessible via a unique link for 24 hours, after which they are no longer publicly accessible. We may retain audit data internally beyond this period.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Analytics</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use the site. This collects anonymised usage data such as pages visited, time on site, and device information. Google may set cookies in your browser to support this. You can opt out by using a browser extension such as <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">Google's Analytics Opt-out Add-on</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        We use a localStorage preference for theme (light/dark mode). Google Analytics may set cookies for analytics purposes. We do not use cookies for advertising or tracking beyond basic site analytics.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Third parties</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        We use Google Cloud Platform (hosting, storage, functions) and Google Analytics. We do not sell your data to third parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        If you have questions about this policy or want your audit data removed, contact us at <a href="mailto:zachary.gander@prophetfrom.ai" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">zachary.gander@prophetfrom.ai</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
